      "content": "Escape Character and Sequences"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Escape sequences allow you to perform special operations on strings. Common escape sequences include:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "\\n - Newline",
        "\\t - Tab",
        "\\' - Single quote",
        "\\\" - Double quote",
        "\\\\ - Backslash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "1console.log(\"Hello\\tWorld\");    // Output: Hello    World\n2\n3let speech = \"John said, \\\"Hello!\\\"\";\n4console.log(speech);    // Output: John said, \"Hello!\""
